%% title: From draft to finalised
%% desc: A new promotion list starts as a draft. In the draft you can change decisions, update it from the results, or delete it, and no student changes. Pressing Finalise, after extra approval if anything was changed by hand, moves everyone at once: those who pass go to the next class, those retained go to a class of the same level, and graduates become Graduated. After finalising it cannot be undone.
flowchart LR
  D["Draft list<br/>nothing changes for students"]:::note
  D -->|"change decisions<br/>update from results"| D
  D -->|"Delete list"| X["Deleted"]:::note
  D -->|"Finalise"| A{"Changed by hand?"}:::admin
  A -->|"Yes: extra approval"| C["Finalised<br/>cannot be undone"]:::guardian
  A -->|"No"| C
  C --> O1["Promote:<br/>next class, new roll"]:::teacher
  C --> O2["Retain:<br/>same level class again"]:::teacher
  C --> O3["Graduate:<br/>status Graduated"]:::teacher
  classDef teacher fill:#e7f5ff,stroke:#1c7ed6,color:#0b3d66
  classDef admin fill:#fff4e6,stroke:#e8590c,color:#7a2e05
  classDef guardian fill:#ffe3e3,stroke:#c92a2a,color:#5c0a0a
  classDef note fill:#f1f3f5,stroke:#868e96,color:#343a40
